    Release: milestone, done, 2000, 2000
    Press: milestone, done, 3000, 3000
    Release: milestone, done, 4000, 4000
    tickInterval 1day
    section ㅤㅤ
    A1: 0, 1s
    A2: active, 1000, 2s
    A1: 3000, 2s
